    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c9ab1f2a855c1d5838e43cc182db387ff71c7b8be07d46518a5828358fe7e964",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "お、目が覚めたな？\nオーク娘の住処に単身で乗り込んでくるとはいい度胸じゃねぇか。\n純潔エルフの弓使いってのが…………まあ、非常に残念だけどな。",
      "jp_sha256": "0e756f55c162837f3d11d20f51fa05fb84b71258a98edefc6851c04636cfd709",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "오, 눈을 떴군?\n오크 소녀의 소굴에 혼자 쳐들어오다니 제법 배짱이 있잖아.\n순결한 엘프 궁수라는 게………… 뭐, 무척 아쉽지만.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "faa469225d004d5ea4447ec0725b00d78735ba594ffc29cdb3c4abac9a5ae7c4:000000_-2327855607305243828:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ポデル",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_左中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
